{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sportverenigingen en maatschappij 2014"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:62971"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J van Kalmthout"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Mulier Instituut"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"R van den Dool"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Mulier Instituut"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>De afgelopen jaren is voor het ministerie van Volksgezondheid, Welzijn en Sport (VWS) een aantal zaken van sportverenigingen in beeld gebracht en gevolgd. Om deze ontwikkelingen te blijven volgen, is een aantal vragen aan verenigingen voorlegd. Centraal staat hoe verenigingen omgaan met de maatschappelijke rol die zij vervullen.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>In het tabblad variable view van het .sav bestand staan de variabelen in dezelfde volgorde als de vragenlijst (vanaf de variabele 'accomm14'). De gebruikte variabele namen corresponderen niet direct met de vraagnummers in de vragenlijst. De labels van de variabelen corresponderen wel met de vraagtekst. Met een dot variabele zijn de vraagteksten toegevoegd die horen bij een multiple respons vraagtype.<\/p><p>Het Mulier Instituut heeft het sav bestand geleverd. Op basis van dit bestand heeft DANS het dta en het por bestand toegevoegd.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"sportverenigingen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"maatschappelijke rol"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"leden en activiteiten"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"beleid"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"organisatie"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2015-12-10"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2015-12-10"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2015-12-10"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Verenigingspanel Mulier Instituut"]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Mulier Instituut"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"di